# Demo CT series: a real, CC BY 3.0-licensed LIDC-IDRI patient CT series,
# tracked via Git LFS rather than a plain blob so it doesn't bloat every
# clone's .git history. Scoped to this one directory --
# engine/tests/fixtures/CT_small.dcm (40KB) stays a normal blob. Lives at
# the repo root (not under engine/) since it's a shared resource --
# ai-pipeline's quantization calibration pool draws from the same
# LIDC-IDRI collection (see ai-pipeline/quantization/README.md). See
# test-data/lidc_idri/README.md for citation/attribution.
test-data/lidc_idri/**/*.dcm filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# Demo brain MR series: one real, de-identified UPENN-GBM patient series
# (T2 SAG SPACE), CC BY 4.0 -- see test-data/upenn_gbm/README.md for
# citation/attribution. Same "shared resource, LFS to avoid bloating
# .git" reasoning as the LIDC-IDRI line above.
test-data/upenn_gbm/**/*.dcm filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
viewer/src/shell/public/models/lungmask_r231_fp16.onnx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# Minimal committed subset of ai-pipeline/quantization/calibration_data/'s
# LIDC-IDRI-derived test fixtures (see .gitignore's exception there and
# ai-pipeline/quantization/README.md) -- same LFS-for-real-imaging-data
# pattern as the two lines above.
ai-pipeline/quantization/calibration_data/inference_fixtures/*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
ai-pipeline/quantization/calibration_data/ground_truth_fixtures/*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
